mese%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22war%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Waray%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22cy%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Welsh%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22fy%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Western+Frisian%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22wo%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Wolof%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22xh%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Xhosa%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22yi%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Yiddish%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22yo%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Yoruba%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22languageCode%22%3A%22zu%22%2C%22languageName%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Zulu%22%7D%7D%5D%2C%22defaultAudioTrackIndex%22%3A18%7D%7D%2C%22videoDetails%22%3A%7B%22videoId%22%3A%22yIVMyu1zFd0%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22James%E2%80%99s+Money+Logic%22%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A30%2C%22keywords%22%3A%5B%22Bank%22%2C%22Banking%22%2C%22Finance%22%2C%22Money%22%2C%22Money+101%22%2C%22Money+Hack%22%2C%22Money+Logic%22%2C%22Money+goals.%22%2C%22Savings%22%2C%22Spending%22%2C%22Stocks%22%2C%22Tips%22%2C%22Wells+Fargo%22%2C%22Wells+Fargo+YouTube%22%5D%2C%22channelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isOwnerViewing%22%3Afalse%2C%22shortDescription%22%3A%22We+all+have+our+own+unique+money+logic.+With+tools+to+track+spending%2C+James+is+able+to+resist+temptation.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.%5CnLearn+more+at+wellsfargo.com%2Fmoneysmart%5Cn%5CnTranscript%3A%5Cn%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Banking%2C+specifically+the+ability+to+track+spending+in+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app.+This+video+features+a+man%2C+James%2C+staring+longingly+at+a+pair+of+limited-edition+shoes+in+a+store+window.+He+is+tempted+to+buy+them+but+also+wants+to+be+conscious+of+his+monthly+spending.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+a+man%2C+James%2C+walking+past+a+cool+sneaker+store+on+the+street.+One+%E2%80%98limited+edition%E2%80%99+sneaker+displayed+in+the+window+of+the+store+catches+his+eye+through+and+stops+him+in+his+tracks.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+James+is+a+man+in+love.+But+he%E2%80%99s+a+man+who%E2%80%99s+been+burned+by+love+before.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+continues+to+stare+at+the+shoes+through+the+window%2C+considering+purchasing+them.+Will+he+give+into+the+temptation%3F%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+So+he+believes+keeping+a+close+watch+on+his+spending+helps+him+resist+temptation.+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+Wells+Fargo+gets+the+logic.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+looks+down+at+his+phone%2C+with+the+%27Your+spending%E2%80%99+section+of+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app+open.+His+spending+is+up+13%25+from+this+time+last+month.%5D%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A%5Cn+%5CnScreen+images+simulated.+Availability+may+be+affected+by+your+mobile+carrier%E2%80%99s+coverage+area.+Message+and+data+rates+may+apply.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+And+helps+him+track+spending+in+their+mobile+app.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+takes+a+final+look+at+the+shoes+and+walks+away%2C+ultimately+deciding+to+not+purchase+the+shoes.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+is+satisfied%2C+almost+proud+of+his+decision+to+not+impulsively+spend+money+on+the+shoes%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+Keep+walking%2C+James%E2%80%A6keep+walking.%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%2C%22isCrawlable%22%3Atrue%2C%22thumbnail%22%3A%7B%22thumbnails%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FyIVMyu1zFd0%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLALJHZuhMQYvJMYLlVftRpMx0Pt7Q%22%2C%22width%22%3A168%2C%22height%22%3A94%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2FyIVMyu1zFd0%2Fhqdefault.jpg%3Fsqp%3D-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ%3D%3D%5Cu0026rs%3DAOn4CLA9_Hp4b65yMU3tQyw9CzAtAduO8Q%22%2C%22width%22%3A