ique+money+logic.+With+tools+to+track+spending%2C+James+is+able+to+resist+temptation.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.%5CnLearn+more+at+wellsfargo.com%2Fmoneysmart%5Cn%5CnTranscript%3A%5Cn%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Banking%2C+specifically+the+ability+to+track+spending+in+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app.+This+video+features+a+man%2C+James%2C+staring+longingly+at+a+pair+of+limited-edition+shoes+in+a+store+window.+He+is+tempted+to+buy+them+but+also+wants+to+be+conscious+of+his+monthly+spending.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+a+man%2C+James%2C+walking+past+a+cool+sneaker+store+on+the+street.+One+%E2%80%98limited+edition%E2%80%99+sneaker+displayed+in+the+window+of+the+store+catches+his+eye+through+and+stops+him+in+his+tracks.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+James+is+a+man+in+love.+But+he%E2%80%99s+a+man+who%E2%80%99s+been+burned+by+love+before.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+continues+to+stare+at+the+shoes+through+the+window%2C+considering+purchasing+them.+Will+he+give+into+the+temptation%3F%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+So+he+believes+keeping+a+close+watch+on+his+spending+helps+him+resist+temptation.+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+Wells+Fargo+gets+the+logic.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+looks+down+at+his+phone%2C+with+the+%27Your+spending%E2%80%99+section+of+the+Wells+Fargo+Mobile%C2%AE+app+open.+His+spending+is+up+13%25+from+this+time+last+month.%5D%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A%5Cn+%5CnScreen+images+simulated.+Availability+may+be+affected+by+your+mobile+carrier%E2%80%99s+coverage+area.+Message+and+data+rates+may+apply.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+And+helps+him+track+spending+in+their+mobile+app.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+takes+a+final+look+at+the+shoes+and+walks+away%2C+ultimately+deciding+to+not+purchase+the+shoes.%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BJames+is+satisfied%2C+almost+proud+of+his+decision+to+not+impulsively+spend+money+on+the+shoes%5D%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+Keep+walking%2C+James%E2%80%A6keep+walking.%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%7D%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A31%2C%22ownerProfileUrl%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40wellsfargo%22%2C%22externalChannelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isFamilySafe%22%3Afalse%2C%22availableCountries%22%3A%5B%22AD%22%2C%22AE%22%2C%22AF%22%2C%22AG%22%2C%22AI%22%2C%22AL%22%2C%22AM%22%2C%22AO%22%2C%22AQ%22%2C%22AR%22%2C%22AS%22%2C%22AT%22%2C%22AU%22%2C%22AW%22%2C%22AX%22%2C%22AZ%22%2C%22BA%22%2C%22BB%22%2C%22BD%22%2C%22BE%22%2C%22BF%22%2C%22BG%22%2C%22BH%22%2C%22BI%22%2C%22BJ%22%2C%22BL%22%2C%22BM%22%2C%22BN%22%2C%22BO%22%2C%22BQ%22%2C%22BR%22%2C%22BS%22%2C%22BT%22%2C%22BV%22%2C%22BW%22%2C%22BY%22%2C%22BZ%22%2C%22CA%22%2C%22CC%22%2C%22CD%22%2C%22CF%22%2C%22CG%22%2C%22CH%22%2C%22CI%22%2C%22CK%22%2C%22CL%22%2C%22CM%22%2C%22CN%22%2C%22CO%22%2C%22CR%22%2C%22CU%22%2C%22CV%22%2C%22CW%22%2C%22CX%22%2C%22CY%22%2C%22CZ%22%2C%22DE%22%2C%22DJ%22%2C%22DK%22%2C%22DM%22%2C%22DO%22%2C%22DZ%22%2C%22EC%22%2C%22EE%22%2C%22EG%22%2C%22EH%22%2C%22ER%22%2C%22ES%22%2C%22ET%22%2C%22FI%22%2C%22FJ%22%2C%22FK%22%2C%22FM%22%2C%22FO%22%2C%22FR%22%2C%22GA%22%2C%22GB%22%2C%22GD%22%2C%22GE%22%2C%22GF%22%2C%22GG%22%2C%22GH%22%2C%22GI%22%2C%22GL%22%2C%22GM%22%2C%22GN%22%2C%22GP%22%2C%22GQ%22%2C%22GR%22%2C%22GS%22%2C%22GT%22%2C%22GU%22%2C%22GW%22%2C%22GY%22%2C%22HK%22%2C%22HM%22%2C%22HN%22%2C%22HR%22%2C%22HT%22%2C%22HU%22%2C%22ID%22%2C%22IE%22%2C%22IL%22%2C%22IM%22%2C%22IN%22%2C%22IO%22%2C%22IQ%22%2C%22IR%22%2C%22IS%22%2C%22IT%22%2C%22JE%22%2C%22JM%22%2C%22JO%22%2C%22JP%22%2C%22KE%22%2C%22KG%22%2C%22KH%22%2C%22KI%22%2C%22KM%22%2C%22KN%22%2C%22KP%22%2C%22KR%22%2C%22KW%22%2C%22KY%22%2C%22KZ%22%2C%22LA%22%2C%22LB%22%2C%22LC%22%2C%22LI%22%2C%22LK%22%2C%22LR%22%2C%22LS%22%2C%22LT%22%2C%22LU%22%2C%22LV%22%2C%22LY%22%2C%22MA%22%2C%22MC%22%2C%22MD%22%2C%22ME%22%2C%22MF%22%2C%22MG%22%2C%22MH%22%2C%22MK%22%2C%22ML%22%2C%22MM%22%2C%22MN%22%2C%22MO%22%2C%22MP%22%2C%22MQ%22%2C%22MR%22%2C%22MS%22%2C%22MT%22%2C%22MU%22%2C%22M