764332},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"7 Months Free on FFScout annual 👉 https://s.id/FPLFocal\n\nThis is my FPL Team for Gameweek 1 with the Bench Boost planned. FPL tips to help with your draft! This is your complete FPL GW1 guide to Fantasy Premier League 2026/27 tips for the season!\n\n📲 Install my FREE FPL app: https://s.id/Focal\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔴 Become a Member: https://youtube.com/FPLFocal/join\n🟠 Become a Patron:   / fplfocal  \nℹ️ Get early access to videos, the members league + Discord channel, badge by your name in comments + streams. Thank you 👊 |\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎁 Win at FPL with FFScout 👉 https://s.id/FPLFocal\n⚔️ League: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea... (code: buuuks)\n🔥 My website: https://fpl.page\n💬   / discord   (13K+ members)\n⚽ https://x.com/FPLFocal\n📷   / fplfocal  \n🦋 https://bsky.app/profile/fpl.page\n🎧 https://linktr.ee/FPLFocal (podcasts)\n📩 oscar@fpl.page\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📽 Recommended videos:\n   • The Biggest FPL Score Of All-Time | Record...  \n   • The All-Time FPL Dream Team | INSANE Scores  \n   • The Worst FPL Score Of All-Time | Disaster...  \n   • The Greatest FPL Manager Of All-Time | Fáb...  \n   • FPL's Worst EVER Disasters  \n   • If 11/12 Messi was in FPL | IMPOSSIBLE Sco...   \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🏆 Mini-league Champions\n25/26: David Whitlock\n24/25: Lovro Budišin\n23/24: Jonas Sand Låbakk\n22/23: Leo Karaj\n21/22: Ben Osman\n20/21: Kiran Paul\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎵 Song credit: Harris Heller - Cielo\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":35,"length":21,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAYiEwiN5YH_8quWAxWJkcsBHZPVL39Ihue6yOP6t5R4ygEEPDpTNg==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUjZOUld1a29nZ0JXVkhEWk45d2dPb3xBR3JiS2FsYUxadzdnV1dHUFlWYVFrMXlXak5DS3RoWHhDWGZJbFRRbllzQU9xVl81MTlwdnMxUF9vcVFwN3VVSjdGSHI0MVN3RUR6dXBrbzZ2RUVuZ2ZpYnRZOGh6ZWdnT1M2\u00